{"condition": "s400", "hits": [{"rank": 1, "score": 0.5768423080444336, "chunk_id": "bafb752da7ce0198c21195ef7d96b6651249b639d53965d0bc1ccb7e7a5bc179", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s400", "document_id": "eu_unfair_terms_93_13", "article_ids": ["eu_unfair_terms_93_13:article:3"], "start": 9844, "end": 10132, "text": "Article 3
1. A contractual term which has not been individually negotiated shall be regarded as unfair if, contrary to the requirement of good faith, it causes a significant imbalance in the parties' rights and obligations arising under the contract, to the detriment of the consumer.
2. ", "title": "Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31993L0013", "article_labels": ["Article 3"]}, {"rank": 2, "score": 0.574378252029419, "chunk_id": "9fc99847a61420e9932265765a35e54703d3bf8ecc461639d2f05c63533cfba1", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s400", "document_id": "eu_unfair_terms_93_13", "article_ids": ["eu_unfair_terms_93_13:article:6"], "start": 12066, "end": 12422, "text": "Article 6
1. Member States shall lay down that unfair terms used in a contract concluded with a consumer by a seller or supplier shall, as provided for under their national law, not be binding on the consumer and that the contract shall continue to bind the parties upon those terms if it is capable of continuing in existence without the unfair terms.
2. ", "title": "Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31993L0013", "article_labels": ["Article 6"]}, {"rank": 3, "score": 0.5708173513412476, "chunk_id": "58742c273abea8ce989f950c0479ff2fd59e1bd71139ee8f94364e6912ccd164", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s400", "document_id": "eu_unfair_terms_93_13", "article_ids": ["eu_unfair_terms_93_13:article:7"], "start": 12729, "end": 12971, "text": "Article 7
1. Member States shall ensure that, in the interests of consumers and of competitors, adequate and effective means exist to prevent the continued use of unfair terms in contracts concluded with consumers by sellers or suppliers.
2. ", "title": "Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31993L0013", "article_labels": ["Article 7"]}, {"rank": 4, "score": 0.5683714747428894, "chunk_id": "874595564f061afa26aa83dbe0d6d598049bd1ca31d6fce734145cd622425536", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s400", "document_id": "eu_unfair_terms_93_13", "article_ids": [], "start": 7365, "end": 7721, "text": "Whereas Member States should ensure that unfair terms are not used in contracts concluded with consumers by a seller or supplier and that if, nevertheless, such terms are so used, they will not bind the consumer, and the contract will continue to bind the parties upon those terms if it is capable of continuing in existence without the unfair provisions;
", "title": "Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31993L0013", "article_labels": []}, {"rank": 5, "score": 0.5631709098815918, "chunk_id": "df01a5296e37c736e558bb2c50a86b0e7ecbf24aa3c90fcd22379e102aa06b94", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s400", "document_id": "eu_unfair_terms_93_13", "article_ids": ["eu_unfair_terms_93_13:article:2"], "start": 9350, "end": 9626, "text": "Article 2
For the purposes of this Directive:
(a) ‘unfair terms’ means the contractual terms defined in Article 3;
(b) ‘consumer’ means any natural person who, in contracts covered by this Directive, is acting for purposes which are outside his trade, business or profession;
", "title": "Council Directive 93/13/EEC of 5 April 1993 on unfair terms in consumer contracts", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:31993L0013", "article_labels": ["Article 2"]}], "timing_ms": 149.969, "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "index_version": "e1d9e93d8abeea648bf64a2e7ac215e39f051a3c715dbe2ffa0664dac8b302bf"}

