{"condition": "f800", "hits": [{"rank": 1, "score": 0.7997373342514038, "chunk_id": "9537081ab41fdb1a9162e9e530f4333f21f95e392d18175b87dc8ce2d3ec915a", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "f800", "document_id": "eu_digital_content_2019_770", "article_ids": ["eu_digital_content_2019_770:article:19"], "start": 107200, "end": 108000, "text": " of time, the trader may modify the digital content or digital service beyond what is necessary to maintain the digital content or digital service in conformity in accordance with Articles 7 and 8, if the following conditions are met:
