", "title": "Directive (EU) 2019/770 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 20 May 2019 on certain aspects concerning contracts for the supply of digital content and digital services (Text with EEA relevance.)", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/770/oj", "article_labels": ["Article 7"]}, {"rank": 4, "score": 0.7072163820266724, "chunk_id": "50b2dd99416e2c1416a725ce8cac45cd7c53f8b0e41b9c6b1ef17600a005c51e", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s800", "document_id": "eu_sale_of_goods_2019_771", "article_ids": [], "start": 13926, "end": 14578, "text": "(16) In contrast, if the absence of the incorporated or inter-connected digital content or digital service does not prevent the goods from performing their functions, or if the consumer concludes a contract for the supply of digital content or a digital service which does not form part of the contract concerning the sale of goods with digital elements, that contract should be considered to be separate from the contract for the sale of the goods, even if the seller acts as an intermediary of that second contract with the third-party supplier, and could fall within the scope of Directive (EU) 2019/770 if the conditions of that Directive are met. ", "title": "Directive (EU) 2019/771 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 20 May 2019 on certain aspects concerning contracts for the sale of goods, amending Regulation (EU) 2017/2394 and Directive 2009/22/EC, and repealing Directive 1999/44/EC (Text with EEA relevance.)", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32019L0771", "article_labels": []}, {"rank": 5, "score": 0.7022984623908997, "chunk_id": "eda1db6e84ce81849b6eb772a7b9c4273a4a8bd90e9ae94dc5365471fe46dba6", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "condition": "s800", "document_id": "eu_digital_content_2019_770", "article_ids": [], "start": 27875, "end": 28568, "text": "However, in order to ensure consistency with the sector-specific provisions of Directive (EU) 2018/1972 of the European Parliament and of the Council (10) regulating bundle contracts, where a trader offers, within the meaning of that Directive, digital content or a digital service in combination with a number-based interpersonal communications service or an internet access service, the provisions of this Directive on the modification of digital content should not apply to the digital content or digital service element of the bundle. The relevant provisions of Directive (EU) 2018/1972 should instead apply to all elements of the bundle, including the digital content or digital service.
", "title": "Directive (EU) 2019/770 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 20 May 2019 on certain aspects concerning contracts for the supply of digital content and digital services (Text with EEA relevance.)", "source_url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/770/oj", "article_labels": []}], "timing_ms": 224.999, "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "index_version": "e1d9e93d8abeea648bf64a2e7ac215e39f051a3c715dbe2ffa0664dac8b302bf"}, "sources_verified": true, "context_chars": 3532, "attempts": [{"number": 1, "started_at": "2026-11-20T13:50:59.352980+00:00", "response": {"id": "4e67e458-2e28-4da7-8dda-e271b9084209", "created": 1795182661, "model": "CS5351/DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "object": "chat.completion", "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"content": "{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"Where the contract provides that the digital content or digital service is to be supplied or made accessible to the consumer over a period of time, the trader may modify it beyond what is necessary to maintain conformity in accordance with Articles 7 and 8 if the conditions in Article 19(1) are met.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The contract must allow, and provide a valid reason for, such a modification.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The modification must be made without additional cost to the consumer.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The consumer must be informed in a clear and comprehensible manner of the modification.","citation_numbers":[1]}]}", "role": "assistant", "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens": 1537, "total_tokens": 1687, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1409}}, "content": "{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"Where the contract provides that the digital content or digital service is to be supplied or made accessible to the consumer over a period of time, the trader may modify it beyond what is necessary to maintain conformity in accordance with Articles 7 and 8 if the conditions in Article 19(1) are met.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The contract must allow, and provide a valid reason for, such a modification.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The modification must be made without additional cost to the consumer.","citation_numbers":[1]},{"text":"The consumer must be informed in a clear and comprehensible manner of the modification.","citation_numbers":[1]}]}", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 150, "prompt_tokens": 1537, "total_tokens": 1687, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 1409}, "model": "CS5351/DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "finish_reason": "stop", "state": "completed", "finished_at": "2026-11-20T13:51:03.964494+00:00"}], "timing_ms": {"retrieve": 224.999, "generate": 4627.650499998708}, "configuration": {"schema_version": "1.0", "mode": "formal", "corpus_version": "794e3d1956fc324659da149d5bfb0e083d257845895057b631d4578ec5b29795", "gold_version": "9ecc1d148c00dacc354a401bdeae7dc019de871919d9ad673a53a9e491e9f07d", "conditions": ["f400", "s400", "f800", "s800"], "top_k": 5, "data_dir": "E:\2027CityU\CS5481 Data Engineering\GroupProject\DERag\data\formal_corpus", "gold_dir": "E:\2027CityU\CS5481 Data Engineering\GroupProject\DERag\data\eval", "structure_dir": "E:\2027CityU\CS5481 Data Engineering\GroupProject\DERag\data\processed", "input_adapter": "eurlex-a-v1", "embedding": {"model_id": "BAAI/bge-m3", "revision": "5617a9f61b028005a4858fdac845db406aefb181", "model_dir": "E:\2027CityU\CS5481 Data Engineering\GroupProject\DERag\models\embedding", "device": "cpu", "dimension": 1024, "normalize": true, "query_prefix": "", "document_prefix": "", "max_input_tokens": 8192, "pooling": "cls", "batch_size": 4, "cpu_threads": 4}, "retrieval